RUF017 [*] Avoid quadratic list summation
 --> RUF017_0.py:5:1
  |
4 | # RUF017
5 | sum([x, y], start=[])
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
6 | sum([x, y], [])
7 | sum([[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6]], start=[])
  |
help: Replace with `functools.reduce`
  |
1 + import functools
2 ~ import operator
3 | x = [1, 2, 3]
4 | y = [4, 5, 6]
5 |
6 | # RUF017
7 + functools.reduce(operator.iadd, [x, y], [])
  |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

